    'Initial final-key evidence inspection attempted JSON parsing of the Markdown source record and returned exit 1; recovered by text reading, without mutation.',
    'Broad final-key text projections were truncated; compact targeted projections recovered the relevant evidence without new images.',
    'Initial key-freeze execution returned exit 1 before writing its record because it asserted full render-report byte identity. Targeted text comparison found only spec.path and output.svg.path relocation in all six reports. The owned helper was corrected to require all nonpath fields equal; no author asset was changed and no render occurred.',
  ],
  boundaries: 'Only owned key records written. No author changes, canonical PASS, validator, installation, skill/app edit, git, database, publication, retention, paid API, browser, image, render, new chat/branch/tree, timer or cross-chat action.',
  usage: { host_tokens: 'UNKNOWN', host_cost: 'UNKNOWN', external_API: 0, paid_calls: 0 },
